1
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:52,520
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:54,200
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,920
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:58,920
=Episode 13=

5
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:05,680
You're so bad.

6
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:11,480
Then...

7
00:01:11,959 --> 00:01:14,000
I'll wait for your good news, Ms. Layla.

8
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:16,400
One second.

9
00:01:24,239 --> 00:01:25,680
No need to be so formal anymore.

10
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:27,040
Just call me Layla.

11
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:29,640
And...

12
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,760
next time we meet,

13
00:01:32,519 --> 00:01:33,760
bring me some flowers.

14
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:39,359
If we want to get under Natuo's skin,

15
00:01:43,159 --> 00:01:45,280
we need to look a little closer, right?

16
00:02:03,359 --> 00:02:04,000
Mr. Suowen.

17
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,879
Your condition's getting worse.

18
00:02:06,239 --> 00:02:07,840
If we can't find a matching heart soon,

19
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:08,560
I'm afraid...

20
00:02:09,719 --> 00:02:10,560
Just tell me.

21
00:02:11,599 --> 00:02:12,800
How much time do I have?

22
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:14,639
About...

23
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:15,840
a month.

24
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,159
One month.

25
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:19,439
That's enough.

26
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:20,560
Boss.

27
00:02:21,759 --> 00:02:22,759
Mian wants to see you.

28
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,000
Perfect.

29
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,599
He's walking right into my hands.

30
00:02:30,599 --> 00:02:31,599
Tell him to come alone.

31
00:02:32,479 --> 00:02:33,479
Get our men

32
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:34,639
ready.

33
00:02:35,159 --> 00:02:35,479
Okay.

34
00:02:50,479 --> 00:02:51,080
Stop the car!

35
00:02:54,639 --> 00:02:55,240
Search it.

36
00:03:03,479 --> 00:03:04,120
What for?

37
00:03:07,639 --> 00:03:08,960
Dropping something off for Boss Suowen.

38
00:03:13,439 --> 00:03:14,000
Take it out.

39
00:03:24,919 --> 00:03:25,240
Come.

40
00:03:25,719 --> 00:03:26,120
Now.

41
00:04:09,039 --> 00:04:09,879
So Mr. Mian

42
00:04:10,439 --> 00:04:11,960
finally remembered me.

43
00:04:12,639 --> 00:04:12,879
Here.

44
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:13,879
Have a seat.

45
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:38,639
Suowen.

46
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:41,040
You know why I'm here?

47
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,600
Mr. Mian.

48
00:04:44,439 --> 00:04:45,079
Go ahead.

49
00:04:45,439 --> 00:04:46,160
Speak freely.

50
00:04:47,319 --> 00:04:48,120
Good.

51
00:04:49,079 --> 00:04:50,800
Mr. Suowen, I hear you and Natuo

52
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:51,680
are in business together.

53
00:04:52,199 --> 00:04:53,839
Natuo uses his fake jade
to move your product.

54
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:04,920
They say you're a pro at making drugs.

55
00:05:08,439 --> 00:05:09,439
But this stuff

56
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:10,759
looks pretty mediocre.

57
00:05:27,519 --> 00:05:27,879
No.

58
00:05:29,199 --> 00:05:30,079
This isn't mine.

59
00:05:32,759 --> 00:05:33,879
This is one of Natuo's stones.

60
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,279
He's using his low-grade stuff

61
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,480
to ruin your reputation,

62
00:05:38,079 --> 00:05:39,560
then gradually
take over your customer base.

63
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:45,000
You...

64
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:46,959
You grab some random stone

65
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,120
and make up a story.

66
00:05:49,639 --> 00:05:50,360
Why should I believe you?

67
00:05:51,519 --> 00:05:53,279
I pulled some strings

68
00:05:53,279 --> 00:05:55,560
to get this from Natuo's newest client.

69
00:06:05,279 --> 00:06:06,079
Look at this list.

70
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:08,519
You know all these names, don't you?

71
00:06:10,319 --> 00:06:11,319
If this keeps up,

72
00:06:12,079 --> 00:06:13,120
will there still be a place for you

73
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:13,839
in Langia's drug trade?

74
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,040
Natuo can't be trusted.

75
00:06:20,759 --> 00:06:21,319
Why not cut him loose?

76
00:06:28,319 --> 00:06:29,199
I'll give you a better deal

77
00:06:29,879 --> 00:06:30,879
than he ever will.

78
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:35,120
Fine.

79
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:38,079
If Mian is willing to work with me,

80
00:06:39,279 --> 00:06:40,519
the honor would be mine.

81
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,319
But for this deal,

82
00:06:44,319 --> 00:06:45,439
I only want one thing.

83
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,399
Your...

84
00:06:49,639 --> 00:06:50,279
heart!

85
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:00,839
Natuo? So what?

86
00:07:02,079 --> 00:07:03,120
Mian? So what?

87
00:07:03,839 --> 00:07:04,720
Only the living

88
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:06,839
get to have a say.

89
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:09,120
Once I have your heart,

90
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,079
I'll have plenty of ways

91
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:13,360
to deal with Natuo.

92
00:07:15,199 --> 00:07:15,800
Suowen.

93
00:07:17,279 --> 00:07:18,480
I'm warning you one last time.

94
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:21,279
You sure you want to go up against me?

95
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:26,160
No one else

96
00:07:26,519 --> 00:07:27,439
can find this place.

97
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:29,319
Besides,

98
00:07:30,079 --> 00:07:31,399
your Blaze Gang

99
00:07:31,399 --> 00:07:32,759
just got hit hard.

100
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:34,959
And the men who used to follow you

101
00:07:35,959 --> 00:07:37,160
were all killed by us.

102
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,279
You came here alone.

103
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:41,240
What do I have to fear?

104
00:07:43,759 --> 00:07:44,199
Don't worry.

105
00:07:45,319 --> 00:07:45,879
I'll...

106
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:47,879
make it quick.

107
00:07:49,399 --> 00:07:50,040
Get him!

108
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:51,199
Yes!

109
00:08:02,839 --> 00:08:04,519
Let's see if you've got what it takes.

110
00:08:11,319 --> 00:08:12,600
Anybody makes a move,

111
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:14,240
I'll blow you all up!

112
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:19,439
Hey!

113
00:08:20,879 --> 00:08:21,480
Trying to leave?

114
00:08:24,839 --> 00:08:25,879
Tell them all to stop.

115
00:08:26,639 --> 00:08:27,279
Or...

116
00:08:27,879 --> 00:08:29,120
I'll treat you a grenade right now.

117
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:30,360
- Boss!
- Boss!

118
00:08:33,519 --> 00:08:34,559
How'd you guys get in here?

119
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:36,159
Hey!

120
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:36,840
Hey!

121
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,240
Wait up!

122
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:38,960
I can't keep up!

123
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:40,879
What are you here for?

124
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:41,679
Wait up!

125
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:50,159
Everybody down!

126
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:54,679
My reach is everywhere in Langia.

127
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:57,120
What made you think you could cross me?

128
00:09:05,799 --> 00:09:06,919
Forgot Mian's rules?

129
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,320
Anyone who betrays Mian

130
00:09:09,159 --> 00:09:11,399
gets a blade in each side.

131
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,519
You betrayed me once.

132
00:09:13,519 --> 00:09:13,879
Mian...

133
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:16,799
This makes twice.

134
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,120
Mian...

135
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:26,720
I was wrong.

136
00:09:27,879 --> 00:09:28,480
I apologize.

137
00:09:31,399 --> 00:09:32,320
How about I make it quick

138
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:33,759
and stab you here twice more?

139
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,240
Then you won't need to find a heart.

140
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:37,759
Mian!

141
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:38,600
Mian!

142
00:09:39,039 --> 00:09:40,639
Punish me however you want.

143
00:09:41,159 --> 00:09:42,000
I don't want to die.

144
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:43,679
I swear.

145
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:45,039
I'll never work with

146
00:09:45,039 --> 00:09:45,840
Natuo again.

147
00:09:46,399 --> 00:09:47,799
I'll do whatever you say.

148
00:09:48,279 --> 00:09:49,120
I'll do anything.

149
00:09:50,639 --> 00:09:51,279
You mean it?

150
00:09:52,159 --> 00:09:52,960
Absolutely.

151
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:55,639
Remember.

152
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:58,080
Those two stabs you owe me...

153
00:09:59,519 --> 00:10:00,480
I can collect anytime.

154
00:10:03,679 --> 00:10:04,759
Since you're being such a good boy,

155
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:07,639
I've got another gift for you.

156
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:08,120
Here.

157
00:10:19,799 --> 00:10:20,320
It's yours.

158
00:10:25,799 --> 00:10:26,759
Whose report is this?

159
00:10:28,639 --> 00:10:30,080
What's the name of Natuo's guy?

160
00:10:32,279 --> 00:10:32,720
Tai.

161
00:10:33,639 --> 00:10:34,000
Right?

162
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:35,240
Poor Suowen.

163
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:37,120
The heart you've been looking for

164
00:10:37,679 --> 00:10:39,279
has been right by Natuo all along.

165
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:42,200
And he never even told you.

166
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:43,919
Poor guy.

167
00:10:43,919 --> 00:10:44,360
Let's go.

168
00:11:00,879 --> 00:11:01,720
Natuo!

169
00:11:08,279 --> 00:11:08,759
Boss.

170
00:11:09,159 --> 00:11:10,759
How'd you get that report?

171
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:11,720
What a coincidence.

172
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:14,519
Layla really handed us a huge gift.

173
00:11:14,799 --> 00:11:15,480
I never would've guessed.

174
00:11:16,519 --> 00:11:17,720
That's our boss.

175
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:18,519
You keep getting smarter, Boss.

176
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:23,440
How do you use this thing?

177
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:25,960
You don't know how?

178
00:11:26,559 --> 00:11:26,960
I do.

179
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:27,480
Like this?

180
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,200
Are you nuts?

181
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:30,879
Trying to blow us up?

182
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:32,639
Let go!

183
00:11:34,759 --> 00:11:35,519
Darn it!

184
00:11:36,799 --> 00:11:37,320
Let's go.

185
00:12:05,879 --> 00:12:06,120
Boss.

186
00:12:06,519 --> 00:12:07,399
I hid right away.

187
00:12:09,399 --> 00:12:09,679
Hey.

188
00:12:10,039 --> 00:12:10,399
You're here.

189
00:12:17,399 --> 00:12:18,679
Boss, let me introduce someone.

190
00:12:18,679 --> 00:12:19,120
This is...

191
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:19,840
You're not dead?

192
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:35,840
♪Dust rises along the border♪

193
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:37,160
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

194
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:38,520
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

195
00:12:38,520 --> 00:12:39,920
♪Friends yesterday, now in battle♪

196
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:41,280
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

197
00:12:41,280 --> 00:12:42,600
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

198
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:43,920
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

199
00:12:43,920 --> 00:12:45,600
♪My life is mine to bear♪

200
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:48,440
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

201
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:51,040
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

202
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:53,360
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

203
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,440
♪My fate is mine to command♪

204
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:55,720
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

205
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:57,000
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

206
00:12:57,240 --> 00:12:58,320
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

207
00:12:58,520 --> 00:12:59,600
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

208
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:00,960
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

209
00:13:01,160 --> 00:13:02,280
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

210
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:03,600
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

211
00:13:03,800 --> 00:13:04,880
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

212
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:06,240
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

213
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:07,760
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

214
00:13:08,040 --> 00:13:09,160
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

215
00:13:09,400 --> 00:13:10,520
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

216
00:13:10,640 --> 00:13:13,560
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

217
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:17,240
♪With blood and sweat♪

218
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:18,640
♪I forge my glory♪

219
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:20,040
♪In this world of chaos♪

220
00:13:20,040 --> 00:13:21,120
♪I carve out a road to brighter days♪

221
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:22,600
♪My legend♪

222
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:24,080
♪I'll write every chapter myself♪

223
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:31,240
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

224
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:34,080
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

225
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:36,200
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

226
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:37,480
♪My fate is mine to command♪

227
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:38,760
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

228
